    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94174" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμβλ-ήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from the hive</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς.
				ἔργα μελισσέων</span>
			<i>honey</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1036
			</span></i>:— pecul. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμβληΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ΐδος, πέτρη
			ς</span>. <i>a hole</i> in a rock <i>used by bees as a
			hive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.880
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμβληΐδες μέλισσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.226
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Zon</span>):—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμβλίδες</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (s.v.l.).</div>
